Execute Query operation in Postgres Node (v1) fails to resolve expressions. This is due to a change that set `noDataExpression: true` for the query editor and introduced a `resolveExpression` option in `pgQueryV2` helper. However the node itself was never updated to use it, leaving it broken for over 2 years now. (Change [here](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/commit/beedfb609ccde2ef202e08566580a2e1a6b6eafa#diff-ee22fbdc6e8bd885038c974127430b943196fa3c8d8de918a130efca3c1e198cR77) and [here](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/commit/beedfb609ccde2ef202e08566580a2e1a6b6eafa#diff-e8b4ef88c1fefa1dd82a094000bc47570c7c1d71b4204e3d4675afdc91a3ed14R174))

