Fix a bug where the declarative node does not have `execute` method if it has `methods`. This causes such nodes to return empty responses when used as a tool. Example being the SharePoint node

Workflow to test:
```json
{
  "name": "SharePoint as Tool",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        84
      ],
      "id": "0e233af4-3873-4a16-964d-fb471d8affb1",
      "name": "When clicking ‘Execute workflow’"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "what are my lists in sharepoint?",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        224,
