## Summary

This PR also parses out single quotes so existing nodes which use single quotes are not broken.

This breaks workflows which use Respond to Webhook where the node is configured such that it does all of the following:
-  Responds with Text
-  Uses a non-HTML response (ie: plain-text)
- Does not set a Response Header with `content-type` `text/plain`

