## Related Linear tickets, Github issues, and Community forum posts

* https://community.n8n.io/t/add-requestoptions-to-mcp-client-node/115513: "My use case: Some tools in my MCP server takes longer than the default timeout, which results in a timeout error in n8n MCP client node."

The post above actually asks for a more general solution, namely exposing _all_ the tool call request options. [There aren't that many](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/blob/590d4841373fc4eb86ecc9079834353a98cb84a3/src/shared/protocol.ts#L56) that look interesting to me, but I'm open to changing this PR to expose more options, if you think it'd be better to expose all of them in one go, instead of just adding the single Timeout

