## Summary
New node 'Query' allows running SQL queries on your data as if they were tables in a database.
![image](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/assets/1538266/a3bc2469-34ea-439c-84b0-b556472ce469)

Two modes available
- Treat incoming items as rows of a table
- Select properties in item to treat as a table

![image](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/assets/1538266/161aecd2-23d8-4ace-a28b-66795a0b6685)
![image](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/assets/1538266/eda309f3-205c-4ca6-95cd-f658076a6934)


