There are some edge cases:

- Empty String --> { stringValue: "" }
- Empty Array --> { arrayValue: { values: [] } }
- 'true' --> { booleanValue: true }
- 'false' --> { booleanValue: false }
- '12345678' --> { stringValue: '12345678' }

